  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Boma-Gambella Project IGAD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Overall Objective of the action is to enhance regional governance and collaborative trans-boundary management in the Boma-Gambella landscape, for the benefit of natural resources and people.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objectives are :&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(i) Establishing systems and protocols for transboundary collaboration in the Boma- Gambella landscape (Result 1)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(ii) Operationalization of regional coordination platform for Biodiversity conservation, wildlife law enforcement and transboundary management in HoA - the HAWEN-Horn of Africa Wildlife Enforcement Network (Result 2).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
